            "They may be partially explained by the\nfact that feral cats are smaller and\nreproduce more rapidly than wolves.",
            "They may reflect a response that does not\ntend to be observed in prey species other\nthan ash-grey mice."
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is A (Answer Key: Topic 11, Q16). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
        },
