            "They may be partially attributable to\nphysical characteristics of arctic ground\nsquirrels that are not shared by mule deer."
          ],
          "answer": 3,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is D (Answer Key: Topic 11, Q17). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
