            "Text 1 dispassionately describes Nicholson\nand colleagues' findings and conclusions,\nwhereas Text 2 attempts to convey the\nresearchers' excitement on discovering\nNadir.",
            "Text 1 focuses on features Nadir lacks,\nwhereas Text 2 indicates features it shares\nwith other geological depressions.",
            "Text 1 discusses a single plausible cause of\nNadir, whereas Text 2 evaluates two\npossible causes.",
            "Text 1 emphasizes the evidence supporting\nan asteroid impact as the cause of Nadir,\nwhereas Text 2 argues against that\nexplanation."
          ],
          "answer": 2,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is C (Answer Key: Topic 11, Q23). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
        },
        {
          "id": "satoplam-t11-q024",
