            "A city's food scene can benefit from the\ncity being named a City of Gastronomy.",
            "A significant number of visitors to Rasht\nmay not know that it was named a City of\nGastronomy."
          ],
          "answer": 2,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is C (Answer Key: Topic 11, Q24). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
        },
        {
