            "The colors in an Impressionist painting\nwere often chosen to complement the\ncolors of the frame it would be placed in.",
            "Gold frames were considered especially\ndesirable by those who purchased works\nfrom Impressionist painters."
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is A (Answer Key: Topic 11, Q26). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
        },
