            "Text 1 emphasizes the evidence supporting\nan asteroid impact as the cause of Nadir,\nwhereas Text 2 argues against that\nexplanation."
          ],
          "answer": 2,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is C (Answer Key: Topic 11, Q28). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
